system: Use WASD or arrow keys for movement. You can dash with space, and perform two attacks with left and right clicks. Use enter to advance dialogue.
system: [CORE MATERIALS] can bring you off this planet. It is the only way to fight the [VOID] which will trap you here. Be careful and remember your purpose.
system: For our purposes only, one [CORE MATERIAL] is enough to bring you off this planet. More would be added in the future.
system: [VOIDS] were useful sometimes. But don’t always trust them. They’re still followers of the [VOID]. They can bring you to places you don’t know, but often [CORE MATERIALS] reside in them.
system: Fight [ALIENS] or negotiate with them using the [TRANSLATORS] our company likely gave. They will be with you, till the end.